ingredients:
  - "1/2 cup rice flour"
  - "2/3 cup ragi flour"
  - "Water (as required)"
  - "2 small onions"
  - "1/2 cup chopped cabbage"
  - "1 small capsicum"
  - "1 small carrot"
  - "6 beans"
  - "1 small potato"
  - "2 dsp oil"
  - "1 tsp black pepper powder"
  - "1 green chili"
  - "1/2 tsp ginger paste"
  - "1/2 tsp garlic paste"
  - "Salt to taste"
instructions:
  - "Chop vegetables."
  - "Blanch all vegetables except onion."
  - "Heat oil, stir-fry chili, onion, ginger, and garlic paste."
  - "Add blanched vegetables, salt, and other spices. Cook for 2 minutes."
  - "Make dough by mixing flour with water."
  - "Divide dough and fillings into six portions."
  - "Roll out each dough portion into a small oval shape."
  - "Place fillings in the center and bring the edges together in a round shape."
  - "Boil water, put the balls into boiling water, and cook for 15 minutes."
  - "Serve hot with chutney."
